    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/extras/6519c3a117a91eb6fc69b895ca13ff50.avif?t=1751340902\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span>In Fun School, you play as an electrical technician tasked with shutting down the power to an abandoned school\u2014except, somehow, it mysteriously turned back on. What seems like a routine job quickly spirals into a nightmarish experience as you uncover the dark secrets hidden within the school's halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to Expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 Immersive Horror Gameplay \u2013 Experience a graphically stunning first-person horror game set in a dark, abandoned 1900s-era private boarding school, where every shadow hides a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Unique Puzzles \u2013 Solve environmental puzzles that cleverly integrate with the decayed school setting, forcing you to think outside the box to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 Unpredictable Enemies \u2013 You are not alone. entities stalk you through the school, striking when you least expect it. Stay alert and beware of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Deep Lore &amp; Story \u2013 Fun School is heavily story-driven, packed with mysteries, hidden clues, and a deep backstory. Piece together the dark past of the school\u2014if you dare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Chapter 1 Playtime: ~30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Future chapters and DLCs are planned to expand the experience to 1+ hour of gameplay.)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/extras/7accdc435c58c0669695b63dc1cb918e.avif?t=1751340902\" data-has-big width=800 height=384 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/extras/6519c3a117a91eb6fc69b895ca13ff50.avif?t=1751340902\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span>In Fun School, you play as an electrical technician tasked with shutting down the power to an abandoned school\u2014except, somehow, it mysteriously turned back on. What seems like a routine job quickly spirals into a nightmarish experience as you uncover the dark secrets hidden within the school's halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to Expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 Immersive Horror Gameplay \u2013 Experience a graphically stunning first-person horror game set in a dark, abandoned 1900s-era private boarding school, where every shadow hides a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Unique Puzzles \u2013 Solve environmental puzzles that cleverly integrate with the decayed school setting, forcing you to think outside the box to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 Unpredictable Enemies \u2013 You are not alone. entities stalk you through the school, striking when you least expect it. Stay alert and beware of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Deep Lore &amp; Story \u2013 Fun School is heavily story-driven, packed with mysteries, hidden clues, and a deep backstory. Piece together the dark past of the school\u2014if you dare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Chapter 1 Playtime: ~30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Future chapters and DLCs are planned to expand the experience to 1+ hour of gameplay.)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/extras/7accdc435c58c0669695b63dc1cb918e.avif?t=1751340902\" data-has-big width=800 height=384 /></span></p>",
